  "question": {
    "text": "The number of values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> such that <math><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> are in arithmetic progression&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;(where,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8901;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer function and <math><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8901;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> denotes the fractional part function)",
